:: Deadwood Street Wren Offer
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'wren' 0 'smuggler'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-wren-offer'>>
    <<set _wrenStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.wren>>
    <<if _wrenStory.stage is 0>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Wren has come to the pub for the meeting Landry arranged. <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> makes room for you, keeping a folded scrap of paper clear of the ring left by a glass. "There you are. I hear you can get a delivery finished without making it everybody's business."<br><br>
          <<if $wrenSeen?.includes('heist')>>
            "No party this time," <<nnpc_he 'Wren'>> adds, smiling. "And no dancing. I thought we could try something a little less sociable."
          <<else>>
            "A supplier's been paid for goods that are still sitting in an industrial store. I know someone who would like them to reach the docks."
          <</if>>
          Wren unfolds the paper. There is a loading door marked on one side and a collection point at the docks on the other. "The boxes are mine. The yard isn't, and nobody's invited us in. Don't expect 'collecting a delivery' to make that disappear if we're caught." <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> taps the collection point. "I'll deal with the buyer. You bring your two people."<br><br>
          "Two hundred and sixty for the full load. If we have to leave some of it, the fee comes down. Seventy for getting everyone back with nothing to sell." <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> looks up to make sure you heard that part. "I'd rather agree now than argue about it afterwards. Interested?"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          兰德里约好了这次碰面，伦恩特地来酒馆等你。<<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>给你让出位置，把折起的纸挪到杯底水印沾不到的地方。“来了？听说你能把一趟货送清楚，还不闹得人人都知道。”<br><br>
          <<if $wrenSeen?.includes('heist')>>
            “这次没有派对，”<<nnpc_he 'Wren'>>笑着补上一句，“也不用跳舞。我想，咱们换个不那么热闹的地方试试。”
          <<else>>
            “有个供货人拿了钱，货却还压在工业区的库房。我认识的人很想让那批货到码头去。”
          <</if>>
          伦恩展开那张纸。一面标着装货门，另一面写了码头的接货地点。“箱子是我的。放箱子的院子不是，也没人请咱们进去。被撞见，别指望一句‘来取货’就能没事。”<<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>点点接货地点。“买家由我来应付。你带上那两个人。”<br><br>
          “整批拿到，二百六十镑。少拿了货，报酬也跟着少。要是没东西能卖，但人都回来了，就给七十。”<<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>抬起眼，确认你听清了最后一句。“宁可现在说好，别到时候再争。想接么？”
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'wren' 'accept'>>
    <<elseif _wrenStory.stage is 4>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Wren recognises the folded note when you bring up the job. "That's already settled," <<nnpc_he 'Wren'>> says, leaving it folded. "You remember how it went. So do I."<br><br>
          <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> moves a glass off the spare seat, but does not put another offer on the table.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你提起那趟活，伦恩认出了折起的便条，却没有再展开。“那笔已经结了，”<<nnpc_he 'Wren'>>说，“你记得办得怎么样。我也记得。”<br><br>
          <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>把空位上的酒杯挪开，没有马上往桌上放新的差事。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'wren'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Wren checks the copy of your arrangement. "Same terms," <<nnpc_he 'Wren'>> says. "If you need someone else, tell me here and we'll put it on hold while you sort out the crew. I'd like to know who I'm waiting for." <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> folds the paper again, tucking it safely away from the drinks.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          伦恩看了看留下的约定。“条件照旧，”<<nnpc_he 'Wren'>>说，“想换个人来，就先在这里说一声，把这趟搁下，等你安排好人手再继续。我得知道该等谁。”<<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>又把纸折好，收在酒杯碰不到的地方。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'wren'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'smuggler'>>

:: Deadwood Street Wren Alley
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'wren' 1 'alley'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-wren-alley'>>
    <<set _wrenStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.wren>>
    <<if _wrenStory.stage is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Machinery rattles behind the walls of the industrial alley. Wren waits near the loading door marked on your note, a hand resting on an empty trolley. <<= _wrenStory.crew.map(key => $per_npc[key].name).join(' and ')>> join you outside. Beyond the door is a private loading yard, with no one waiting to let you in.<br><br>
          "There they are. Packed and ready to go. Almost helpful of them." Wren gives the door a sidelong look. Someone moves on the other side, then the sound of an engine swallows their footsteps. "I'd prefer a clear stretch before we start pushing."<br><br>
          You can watch the comings and goings before moving the load, or get the crates onto the trolley and leave quickly. Wren checks the ties on a bundle, still listening to the sounds beyond the door.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          工业区巷道两边的墙后传来机器的响声。伦恩等在便条标出的装货门旁，一只手搭着空板车。<<= _wrenStory.crew.map(key => $per_npc[key].name).join('、')>>也在门外与你会合。门里是私人的卸货院子，没有人在等着让你们进去。<br><br>
          “就在这儿。都包好了，等着搬。真体贴。”伦恩斜眼看看门。另一头有人走动，随后，引擎声盖住了脚步。“要是能挑个清静的时候推走，我会更高兴。”<br><br>
          你可以先留意人员来往，找准动手的时机；也可以赶紧把货箱搬上车，尽快离开。伦恩检查着包裹上的系绳，仍在听门外的动静。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'wren' 'watch'>>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'wren' 'move'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _wrenStory.stage gt 2>>
            The loading door has closed behind the job. Your account of what happened here is already with the rest of the arrangements.
          <<elseif _wrenStory.result is 'success'>>
            The load is clear of the doorway. The trolley's loose wheel knocks against the paving, but the crates stay together.
          <<else>>
            The load is out, though a burst of activity at the door forced you to hurry. A bundle has slipped against the wheel, and the ropes need tightening before the next handover.
          <</if>><br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.stage is 2>>Wren checks the collection point on the note. The next handover is at the docks.<<else>>You can hear the machinery still running inside.<</if>> There is no reason to linger beside the loading door.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _wrenStory.stage gt 2>>
            装货门已经在这趟活后关上。这里发生过的事，已经写在其余记录里。
          <<elseif _wrenStory.result is 'success'>>
            货已经离开门口。板车松动的轮子敲着铺路石，箱子倒还码在一起。
          <<else>>
            货搬出来了，门口突然有人来往，你们只得赶着离开。一件包裹滑到了轮子旁，交货之前得重新勒紧绳子。
          <</if>><br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.stage is 2>>伦恩又确认了一遍便条上的接货地点。下一趟交接在码头。<<else>>你仍能听见里面运转的机器声。<</if>>没有必要继续留在装货门旁。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'wren'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'alley'>>

:: Deadwood Street Wren Docks
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'wren' 2 'docks'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-wren-docks'>>
    <<set _wrenStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.wren>>
    <<if _wrenStory.stage is 2>>
      <<set _wrenCarrier to $per_npc[_wrenStory.crew.find(key => $per_npc[key].heist.role === 'carrier')]>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Near the agreed collection point, the trolley catches in a gap between the stones. <<= _wrenCarrier.name>> takes the weight before it tips, then lets out a sharp breath and puts a hand to a strained leg. The crates settle with a heavy knock. Wren catches the nearest bundle before it can slide into the water.<br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.result is 'success'>>
            You arrived with the load still together. There is room to set part of it down and help the injured member away.
          <<elseif _wrenStory.result is 'setback'>>
            The hurried loading has left everything awkwardly balanced. Getting the whole lot moving again would mean taking the weight yourself and trusting the others to keep up.
          <<else>>
            The last interruption has left the handover unfinished. There is still a choice between taking the load's weight and helping your colleague clear of it.
          <</if>>
          Wren looks towards the buyer's collection point. "We can't keep this sitting here. Your people. Your call. Just don't promise me all the crates if you're leaving half of them."<br><br>
          Helping your injured colleague would mean taking only the easier bundles, for a hundred and seventy pounds. Trying to save the whole load could still earn the full fee, but risks making the strain worse. You can also leave the crates and withdraw together for the agreed seventy.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          快到约好的接货地点时，板车轮子卡进了石缝。<<= _wrenCarrier.name>>抢先撑住倾斜的重量，随即倒抽一口气，伸手按住拉伤的腿。箱子重重落稳，伦恩接住最靠外的一件包裹，没让它滑进水里。<br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.result is 'success'>>
            运到这里的货还码得整齐。你有余地放下一部分，先扶受伤的同伴离开。
          <<elseif _wrenStory.result is 'setback'>>
            先前搬得匆忙，货堆已经歪了。想把整批重新推起来，就得自己扛住重量，再指望其他人跟上。
          <<else>>
            先前的打断让交接悬在这里。你仍得决定，是继续撑住这批货，还是先扶同伴离开。
          <</if>>
          伦恩看看买家的接货处。“不能一直摆在这里。是你的人，你决定。要留下一半，就别答应我整批。”<br><br>
          先照顾受伤的同伴，只带走方便拿的包裹，可以拿到一百七十镑。设法保住整批，仍有机会拿足报酬，但可能让伤势加重。你也可以留下货箱，一起撤走，按约定拿七十镑。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'wren' 'people'>>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'wren' 'cargo'>>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'wren' 'leave'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _wrenStory.outcome is 'people'>>
            The easier bundles have gone through to the buyer. You and the others have helped your injured colleague clear of the trolley, leaving the heavy crates behind.
          <<elseif _wrenStory.outcome is 'cargo'>>
            The last crate has reached the collection point. Wren checks it off, then finally takes a hand away from the load.
          <<else>>
            You have cleared the collection point without the crates. Wren looks back once, then puts the folded note away.
          <</if>><br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.stage is 3>>The buyer's count is finished. Wren has agreed to go over the payment at the smugglers' pub.<<else>>The buyer's count and your payment are already settled.<</if>> The rest of the dock carries on around you.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _wrenStory.outcome is 'people'>>
            方便携带的包裹已经交给买家。你和其他人扶着受伤的同伴离开了板车，把沉重的货箱留在后面。
          <<elseif _wrenStory.outcome is 'cargo'>>
            最后一箱也送到了接货处。伦恩核完数量，总算把扶着货物的手放下来。
          <<else>>
            你们已经离开接货处，没有带上那些箱子。伦恩回头看了一次，收起折好的便条。
          <</if>><br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.stage is 3>>买家的数量已经点清。伦恩约好回走私者酒馆再核报酬。<<else>>买家清点的数量与给你的报酬，都已经结清。<</if>>码头上的其他人仍各忙各的。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'wren'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'docks'>>

:: Deadwood Street Wren Debrief
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'wren' 3 'smuggler'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-wren-debrief'>>
    <<set _wrenStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.wren>>
    <<if _wrenStory.stage is 3>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Wren has found a table out of the main traffic. The buyer's count is on one side of the folded note; your agreement is on the other. <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> sets the two together before looking up at you.<br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.outcome is 'people'>>
            "Less to sell," <<nnpc_he 'Wren'>> says. "But we still have someone to carry the next lot." Wren glances towards the others. "Don't mistake that for me enjoying the smaller payment. A hundred and seventy, as agreed."
          <<elseif _wrenStory.outcome is 'cargo'>>
            "Every crate. You did make that look difficult, though." Wren's smile returns as <<nnpc_he 'Wren'>> checks off the last mark. "Two hundred and sixty. Don't start writing that price on every job I offer you."
          <<else>>
            "I saw what we left behind." Wren smooths the paper with a palm. "Seventy. The price of coming back without a sale." <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> does not look pleased, but leaves the agreed figure on the page.
          <</if>><br><br>
          Wren turns the note so the others can see. "Same account from everyone? Good. Let's finish it." <<nnpc_He 'Wren'>> waits for you to check the payment.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          伦恩找了张不挡来往的桌子。折起的便条一面写着买家清点的数量，另一面是你们的约定。<<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>把两边摆在一起，这才抬头看你。<br><br>
          <<if _wrenStory.outcome is 'people'>>
            “能卖的少了，”<<nnpc_he 'Wren'>>说，“不过，下回还有人搬货。”伦恩朝其他人看了一眼。“别误会，我可没说少拿钱很开心。说好的一百七十。”
          <<elseif _wrenStory.outcome is 'cargo'>>
            “一箱没少。不过，你们可真是费了不少劲。”伦恩勾掉最后一笔，脸上又有了笑意。“二百六十。可别以后我给什么活，你都先填上这个价。”
          <<else>>
            “我看见留下什么了。”伦恩用手掌抹平便条。“七十。没东西能卖，也得付大家回来的钱。”<<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>并不高兴，却没有划掉约好的金额。
          <</if>><br><br>
          伦恩把便条转过去，让其他人也看得见。“说的都是同一回事？那好，把这笔结了。”<<nnpc_He 'Wren'>>等你核对报酬。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'wren' 'settle'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The note has been folded away. <<if _wrenStory.outcome is 'cargo'>>Wren remembers getting every crate through.<<elseif _wrenStory.outcome is 'people'>>Wren remembers the part of the load you left to get your injured colleague clear.<<else>>Wren remembers coming back without the crates.<</if>><br><br>
          "Next time, we know a little more about each other," <<nnpc_he 'Wren'>> says. The smile makes it difficult to tell whether that is a compliment.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          便条已经折起来收好了。<<if _wrenStory.outcome is 'cargo'>>伦恩记得你们把每一箱都交了出去。<<elseif _wrenStory.outcome is 'people'>>伦恩记得，为了扶伤了腿的同伴离开，你们留下一部分货。<<else>>伦恩记得那趟空着手回来的经过。<</if>><br><br>
          “下回，彼此就又多知道一点了。”<<nnpc_he 'Wren'>>说道。看着那抹笑，你不太确定这算不算夸奖。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'wren'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'smuggler'>>
